// Built-in material table: id -> procedural pattern.
//
// Colours are linear RGB (values above 1 glow once lighting and bloom
// exist). `scale` is metres per pattern cell, `speed` animates water, lava,
// emissive and hologram (cycles per second). Ids 0..=13 show one pattern
// each, in pattern order; content lots add ids after them.
